[36.003907, "o", "Done. The proof in `/workspace/plus_comm.v` is complete and compiles successfully.\r\n\r\n**Changes made:**\r\n\r\n- **Base case** (`0 + m = m + 0`): after `simpl` the goal is `m = m + 0`, so `rewrite <- plus_n_O` rewrites the right side back to `m`, then `reflexivity`.\r\n- **Inductive case** (`S (n' + m) = m + S n'`): `rewrite <- plus_n_Sm` transforms the right side into `S (m + n')`, then `rewrite IHn'` turns the goal into `S (m + n') = S (m + n')`, closed by `reflexivity`.\r\n\r\nVerified with:\r\n\r\n```\r\ncoqc plus_comm.v\r\n```\r\n\r\nwhich produced `plus_comm.vo` (14,509 bytes) with no errors or admitted goals.\r\n"]
